WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.190
Then let’s start.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.320
“Things to watch out for during the summer break”

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.050
Everyone listen good.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.470
Firstly, you must live orderly daily lives.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.260
It’s a long vacation, so you may want to try out new experiences,

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.060
What’s wrong with her?

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.220
...but know that if you do, your health may suffer.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.220
She’s been like this the whole morning.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.480
It’s a holiday so you don’t want to go down with a cold...

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.780
Akasaka-san, what’s wrong?

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.110
The other day, Masha was captured wasn’t he?

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.290
During that time,

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.760
it seems the data we received had enemy information mixed along with it.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.570
That’s great, Masha, you did good!

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.670
Masha is great, Masha is great!

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.500
Following that, startling details have been uncovered.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.880
Now let’s bring up the visuals.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.010
Momomiya!

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.000
Momomiya!!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.380
Yes!

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.140
If you sleep, summer break will be over.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:06.310
Hey hey, how’re things
developing for you?

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:08.500
It’s fair... how about you Ichigo?

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.070
Enough!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.040
I don’t want to hear anymore.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.570
Well, what have you planned for this summer break?

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.970
Haven’t you thought of anything yet?

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:18.990
Everything is...

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.910
Well... I’ve been rather busy lately

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.040
There are also other matters of concern.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.100
Matters of concern?

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.940
I know! It must be about Aoyama-kun!

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.170
W-What are you saying?

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:30.380
No?

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.760
No, that’s totally...

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.410
Maybe you and Aoyama-kun are taking a One-
Day Tour of the city walking hand in hand?

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:39.760
I told you, it’s not like that at all!

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.480
Really now, don’t you want to hurry things up?

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.810
That thought...

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.230
So it’s true then?

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.790
No it’s not true!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.650
Oh well...

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.360
It must be the season of love...

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.820
Bye now. I’ll call you later.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.800
Bye bye!

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.530
The season of love eh...?

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.720
No, that’s not what I should be thinking!

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:17.010
This is?

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.280
Yes, this is their area.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.760
However if you observe closely...

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.040
these resemble images of Earth.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.310
Eh?!!

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.950
Have a look at this.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:34.700
Prior to the dawn of humankind
this plant used to thrive on Earth.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:38.450
Having become extinct, now you can
only see it through fossil records.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:43.460
So in certain ways, these visuals could
well be records of their past.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.670
So, they aren’t aliens after all,
but from Earth.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:49.630
That seems to be the case.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.130
But why...?

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.840
These pre-humans of ancient times,

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.260
faced such changes in the environment
that made it impossible to live here.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.360
Finally, despite the odds they migrated to another world.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:10.240
As it turned out, the planet they arrived on
was of far worse condition than on Earth.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:15.330
However, the choice of going to another
planet was just beyond their means.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:21.530
What greeted them when they opened their
eyes after their long sleep shocked them

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.040
as if deliberately setting an environmental
curse upon themselves,

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:31.550
...the blue, beautiful and rich homeland Earth, became a dream much talked about.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.280
I see...

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:44.890
After returning to the much dreamt of Earth...

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:49.640
we humans have gained control of the
Earth and harmed the environment.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.250
If I were them, I’d treat humans as they do too.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.740
Zakuro-san...

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.940
I’m not speaking in their defense.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:02.370
Whatever the reason, they shouldn’t be out harming humanity.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.720
I’m just saying that
I know how they feel.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.790
Everyone, put these images out of your minds.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:10.430
Huh?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.710
Like Zakuro said,

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:18.150
regardless of it; it will not alter the fact
that they are harming humans.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:22.800
Excuse me, is there a way we can talk to them?

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:26.150
If that was possible, there wouldn’t be a need for us.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.770
Shirogane...

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.900
This really is a difficult question.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.340
That hurts... I’m sorry!

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.030
Aoyama-kun!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:41.840
You okay?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.200
Yeah, it’s alright.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.210
Thank goodness!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.420
Good job, Pie.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.770
I had a word with Deep Blue.

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:59.730
“You’d better rejoin the fighting”
he said. It’s all thanks to Pie.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.890
I don’t agree with that.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.450
It doesn’t matter that you disagree.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.600
It’s okay.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.410
He really changed, hasn’t he?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.770
All this fighting has really made him strong.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.600
Yes. Interesting isn’t it?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.670
What do you mean by interesting? What’s next?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:23.570
Let’s put all our powers to good use.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.990
Hrmph, fine by me.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.200
What do you think, Pie?

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.350
There’s no other way...

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.960
It’s been awhile since we had a nice quiet chat.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.050
Yeah.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.270
No plans this summer break?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.220
Yeah. How about you?

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.020
I’m afraid I’ve yet to make any plans...

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.060
Ichigo-san!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:54.100
I know, why don’t we go someplace near for a day?

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.270
Where would you like to go?

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.100
Eh? You mean...

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.290
Yes, two of us...

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:00.110
Really!?!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:01.110
Well for this date...

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.450
one-day tour...

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.710
What are you looking at?

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.890
Ichigo?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.710
What’s wrong? You aren’t eating the parfait.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.960
Taking cold stuff lets my brain have that piercing feeling.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:21.930
You alright?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.590
Yep, I’m alright.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.850
Ichigo onee-cha...

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.140
What now?

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.030
Shhhh~

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.810
W-where shall we go?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.560
Any place that Ichigo likes.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:40.190
Wuah, I’m just so happy!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:44.380
Let me think it over and I’ll call you back, bye!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.240
Ichigo?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:47.370
It’s a real pleasure, thanks!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.200
Why is Ichigo running away?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.870
It’s summer...

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.600
The season of love...

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.940
Yayyy~!!

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.170
Excuse me?

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.560
Coming...

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.300
That’s odd.

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.720
She’s totally forgotten about etiquette.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.390
What’s gotten into her?

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.770
Summer is called the season of love.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.740
Hm, where’s Zakuro?

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.950
She’s busy with a photo shoot for a new collection.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:31.120
The amusement park seems a little hot...
or we could spend the day at the beach.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.200
She’s really gone over the top...

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.350
Must be the summer.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.880
The beach...

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.430
That means I could put on a swim suit
and take a plunge in the sea.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.380
Ya hahahaa~!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.940
Ichigo-san is kinda weird.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.150
Just two more days, two more days!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.180
Ichigo’s acting weird, acting weird.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:55.150
Oh really? It’s summer eh...

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:14.490
Someone must be gossiping behind my back.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.170
Maybe it’s Aoyama-kun?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.770
That’s not a good thing to say.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.670
Really?

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.590
If it’s the Aliens, it’s not really possible to tell.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:28.170
Hmm that’s a tough one...

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.260
You don’t look convincing at all.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.240
Really?

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:37.400
Since they unleashed the monsters, you’ve never been sick.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.890
I know.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:40.580
Well then...

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:44.920
Ichigo.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.380
Yes?

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.340
Take care...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.300
Erm?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.210
It’s nothing.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.170
<i>“If there’s any danger
I’ll be there to protect you”</i>

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.250
Was that what he was gonna say?

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:11.610
Oh c’mon what are you talking about?

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:15.900
What’s Akasaka-san driving at?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.260
Oh my it’s 38.5 celcius.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.430
You will have to rest today.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:32.800
No. Today is... today is...

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.970
Oh no, you don’t... be quiet and rest.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.150
You can’t mess with a flu.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.940
This can’t be.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:53.070
<i>The number you just dialed, has either been turned off or gone beyond signal range.</i>

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:56.740
Ohh... it has to happen now!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.740
Hey Ichigo, caught the flu bug?

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.620
You should sleep.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.250
I can’t do that, today is...

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.010
So you have a date?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.990
What do we have here?

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:11.720
The lady with her outstretched wings wants to search tor a 100 year relationship?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:12.710
This is too much...

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.390
Dad’s going out for a while.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:18.190
I’ll buy you some nice doll pancakes on my way back.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:22.180
Retasu?

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:28.620
Yes I got it, we’ll keep that in mind.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.200
Ichigo-san has fallen ill with flu.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:35.950
She couldn’t contact Aoyama-san and
hopes we can tell him of her condition.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:39.160
Oh my... Why did she have to fall ill?

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.170
Minto-san.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.990
We could all pay her a visit together!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.700
As usual, she avoids any complicated discussions.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:52.340
We’ll all go at the same time, and separating them so they cannot help one another.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:54.670
It’s all very simple and foolproof.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.050
There shouldn’t be any trouble at all.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.770
Let’s start now!

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.270
Ichigo-oneechan!! We’re here to see you.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.570
Thank you.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.490
But I’m still pretty sick.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:16.500
Of all things, why do I have to fall ill?

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.280
How true.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:23.700
We contacted Aoyama-san, and
he is on his way here to see you.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:28.040
Oh dear, I look awful.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.930
I don’t want to be seen dressed like this.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:35.440
Don’t worry, pajamas are sexy too.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:39.400
What are you saying,
I need to get changed.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.110
Ichigo-san.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.740
She’s asleep.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:54.730
Killer instinct levels 88%, how very truthful.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:00.830
Ichigo.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:01.790
Ichigo-san?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.870
Is that Aoyama-kun’s illusion?

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.420
Me and my feelings for Aoyama-kun...

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.210
Aoyama-kun I like you so...

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.220
Ichigo.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.290
I was worried,
but I’m glad it’s just a cold.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.850
This is soo embarrassing.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:24.180
Brother Aoyama is here now.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.060
Well it’s time we leave.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.780
Why? Bu-Ling wants to stay on longer...

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.980
No no, there’s still the Café to attend to.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.480
Wait everyone!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.620
(Why do we have to go!?)

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:40.620
Sorry... I didn’t turn up.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.240
It’s alright.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.040
But we were going to have so much fun.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.950
We can still go after you’ve recovered.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.410
That’s true.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:58.630
I’m glad to be here, even if it’s just to look at Ichigo’s face.

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.550
Aoyama-kun.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.550
If ever anything should happen, I want to be there for Ichigo.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:11.810
However, despite what I may think,

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:15.270
not much can be done about the flu.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.310
How about some tea?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.620
Er, is this a bad time?

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.540
Wait!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.220
Che, it sure is hot!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.330
Please do come again.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.430
Thanks for your hospitality.

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:45.970
Now I really made him worry, but maybe
this cold isn’t so bad after all.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.560
It’s been awhile, how are you?

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:00.240
Okay. I need to head back home for a while.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.290
We’ll return to the Café first!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.980
My throat feels really dry.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:11.070
Then let’s take a look in the Park, there might be spots where you can get a drink.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.190
Since there are sprinklers here
I could take a bath.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.990
You brought your swimsuit?

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:17.870
Mmmm, nope.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:20.450
What was that?

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:21.500
Let’s find out!

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:39.190
Aren’t you from... Café Mew Mew?

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.350
You must be the one they call Aoyama.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:47.180
Yea, are you visiting Momomiya-san?

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.320
Not really.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:52.360
I’m just asking, nothing more.

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:59.580
I’ll take my leave now.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:14.680
Alien! Alien!

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.920
My my, fall sick in the summer?

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:19.900
I thought we could have some fun like before, it’s just too bad.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:23.100
Ichigo run for it! Masha will fight!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.310
I’d be glad to, Masha, but this is the second floor.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:27.860
But be prepared...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.820
My purpose here today is to take Ichigo back to our world,

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.570
then she will be mine forever.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.570
It’s the second floor but I have to try.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.580
Wuah! It’s just too high!!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.420
I knew it, my cat powers
didn't come out.{Wuahh, luckily I have those cat-like powers.}

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:53.130
Wow you really try hard.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.970
Okay now it’s my turn!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.890
You can run but you won’t get far.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.440
Shut up! It’s your fault for picking such a time.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.900
I couldn’t help it, if we’re to take
Ichigo, there’s no better chance.

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:15.530
If you think your friends are going to
help you, then you can stop hoping.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:20.750
At this same moment, Chimera Animas
are striking all over the place.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:28.920
What’s that thing!?

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.840
Chimera Anima?

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.800
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:47.690
Huh?

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:51.520
What the...

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.740
There are Chimeras here too!

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.200
Those are Chimera Animas right?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.590
I don’t want to hurt you, Ichigo.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:20.390
Just come along quietly.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.020
Why must you follow me like a shadow?

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:29.190
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.320
For the future of the earth...

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.730
At your service! ~Nya!

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.900
Oh no! I just can’t muster any strength.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:19.820
The cold is just terrible,
if only I could still fight a little.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:26.360
It must be terrible for you.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:29.420
Despite having transformed, Ichigo is still Ichigo.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.040
StrawberBell!!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:33.750
Take that!

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.930
Eh? You still want more?

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.520
...or do you want to stop?

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.860
You know you can’t escape.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:59.310
I’m so powerless...

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.030
...my injuries...

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:05.030
he’s going to...

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.540
I must be strong...

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:09.990
but...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:34.270
I will... protect you.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.820
Surely I will protect you.

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.420
You are...

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.960
I am...

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.890
The Blue Knight.

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.260
The Blue Kn... Knight?

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.630
The swing is swaying,
the leaves are swaying,

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:30.170
even the tail is swaying... swaying~

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:32.540
Ichigo, your body is swaying.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.630
Yes, it’s my heart that is swaying!

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:40.640
My heart belongs to Aoyama-kun
alone, it belongs to no one else!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.760
What do you really mean?

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:47.360
Just that... the Blue Knight’s appearance has me wondering...

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:50.690
Next: “Mid-Summer’s Episode, Ichigo’s Swaying Heart”

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:53.750
Ichigo, you should be resting when you’re ill.
